# The workspace root holds checkouts, not code — so ignore everything and
# un-ignore the few files this repo actually tracks. That way `main/` and every
# worktree folder you add later (feature-pricing/, bugfix-42/, ...) stay ignored
# whatever you decide to call them.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/bootstrap.sh
!/Tiltfile
# infra/ is tracked; its .env is not — Compose reads the SQL password from it.
!/infra/
/infra/.env
# caddy/ is tracked; the exported root certificate is not.
!/caddy/
/caddy/root.crt
